<title>LUXEMBOURG: SOCCER-RUSSIA BEAT LUXEMBOURG 7-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIA BEAT LUXEMBOURG 7-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia beat Luxembourg 7-1</p>
<p>(halftime 3-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>five qualifier on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Luxembourg - Claude Libar 90</p>
<p>Russia - Dmitri Khokholov 11, Dmitri Shukov 24, Alexander</p>
<p>Shirko 27, 54, Andrei Demchenko 46, 74, Alexander Berketov 62</p>
<p>Attendance: 350</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>against, points):</p>
<p> Russia		  3   2   0   1   9   3   6</p>
<p> Israel		  2   2   0   0   3   0   6</p>
<p> Bulgaria		2   1   0   1   4   2   3</p>
<p> Cyprus		  1   0   0   1   1   2   0</p>
<p> Luxembourg	    2   0   0   2   1  11   0</p>
<p>Next match: Nov 10 Cyprus v Israel</p>
</text>
